        "code": "gsap_repeated_fromto_without_baseline",
        "severity": "warning",
        "message": "2 tl.fromTo() calls target \"#dm-frame\" with no stable baseline. The last-authored fromTo \"from\" values become the element's resting state for any seek before the first tween actually runs, because GSAP applies fromTo from-values at authoring time (immediateRender), not at tween position.",
